        "Title": "That Blasted Sniper!",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN_MOVIESET",
        "PublicId": "105449029736",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/coastaltown/_scene_copperhead.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository fb9c5d0b-e127-4ac5-950c-8e2c39528948).Image",
        "Description": "The movie set on the filming of The Icon has been weary after recent pranking done by local teenagers! They&apos;ve been camping on rooftops and throwing eggs at the movie staff!\r\rThis contract has been issued by Dino Bosco himself, instead of dealing with the problem, deal with the other problem! He has hired us to put an end to the people being targetted by those teenagers. He says this will solve the problem and save lots of money!\r\rHis payment of €400,000,000 should cover the contract, 47.",
